# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Table of supported instructions {#table-of-supported-instructions}"
msgstr "Tableau des instructions prises en charge {#table-of-supported-instructions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operation category |  Name |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Single-qubit gates | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Two-qubit gates | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Fractional gates | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (single-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (two-qubit) |\n"
"| Non-unitary instructions | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Control flow | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (classical feedforward) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Catégorie d'opération |  Nom |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Portes à un qubit | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Portes à deux qubits | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Portes fractionnaires | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (un qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (deux qubits) |\n"
"| Instructions non unitaires | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Flux de contrôle | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (feedforward classique) |\n"

